{"term": {"label": "心", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "亡", "id": "亡"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "大人", "id": "大人"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "寇讎", "id": "寇讎"}, {"form": "心", "variants": [], "id": "心"}, {"form": "思", "id": "思"}, {"form": "患", "id": "患"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "憂", "id": "憂"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "禽獸", "id": "禽獸"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "視", "id": "視"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.404870746692826, "source": "禮", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 0.6164133863285559, "source": "禮", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.6280142980070358, "source": "禮", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 1.2225491898988714, "source": "禮", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.6370144279854584, "source": "視", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 3.147840051751449, "source": "視", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.356080582523394, "source": "視", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.4546928711915035, "source": "視", "target": "寇讎"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "人", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 0.3932698350143462, "source": "人", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "人", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "人", "target": "禽獸"}, {"weight": 0.6164133863285559, "source": "人", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 0.2109482782203915, "source": "人", "target": "心"}, {"wei